{
  "_comment": [
    "The shared case table for montaj_assets/render/sdr-layer.js (JS) and lib/color_provenance.py (Python).",
    "Both test files run EVERY case: JS checks originOf, sdrLayerFor and gradeKeyFor; Python checks origin_of and proxy_source_for.",
    "probes: path -> what the probe returns for it. A path with no entry is a failed probe:",
    "  { transfer: 'unknown', comment: '', width: null, height: null, fps: null, duration: null }.",
    "exists: the paths whose file exists. decodedTransfer: the transfer of the file the caller decodes after normalize.",
    "expect.item: layer.item from sdrLayerFor. Omitted means equal to the input item.",
    "Fingerprint rule: equal display width and height, equal r_frame_rate string, |duration delta| <= max(2 / fps, 0.05) s."
  ],
  "marker": "montaj: converted from SDR source ",
  "cases": [
